BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (something that is difficult for others to copy, although we know that competitors could try.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (Brianna Kowalczyk is our CEO and a junior studying business, she came up with the idea after) Tj T* (watching her grandmother struggle in the kitchen because of arthritis. She leads strategy,) Tj T* (sales and customer relationships. Dev Raghunathan is our CTO and is a senior studying) Tj T* (mechanical engineering, he designed our prototype and handles the molding process and) Tj T* (materials. Tyler Okonkwo-Banks is our head of operations and is a sophomore studying marketing,) Tj T* (he manages our fittings, our social media and our website. Together we bring a mix of business,) Tj T* (technical and creative skills and we are all very passionate about helping people. We have also) Tj T* (spoken with a few advisors including a professor and a local occupational therapist who have) Tj T* (given us helpful feedback, although they are not formally part of the company.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Milestones and Financials) Tj T* () Tj T* (So far we have achieved several important milestones. We have formed a C Corp, built a working) Tj T* (prototype of our grip, launched a website, and most importantly we have our first paying) Tj T* (client, who purchased a set of grips for her kitchen and gardening tools and said she was very) Tj T* (happy with them. This proves that people are willing to pay for what we are offering. We have) Tj T* (spent a small amount of our own money on materials and legal fees. Our financial projections) Tj T* (show strong growth over the next three years, with revenue growing quickly as we reach more) Tj T* (customers, and we expect to become profitable once we reach enough scale. We are confident that) Tj T* (the numbers will work out because the demand is so large and our product provides so much value) Tj T* (to customers.) Tj T* () Tj T* (What We Are Asking For) Tj T* () Tj T* (We are applying to this competition for funding that will help us take Steadyhand Grips to the) Tj T* (next level. With the prize money we would purchase better molding equipment, hire part time) Tj T* (help for the fittings, improve our website, and do more marketing to reach new customers. We) Tj T* (are also looking for mentorship from experienced entrepreneurs and connections to potential) Tj T* (partners such as clinics and senior living communities. Beyond the money, being part of this) Tj T* (competition would give us credibility and visibility which are very important for a young) Tj T* (company like ours. We believe that Steadyhand has the potential to change the lives of many) Tj T* (people and we would be honored to have the chance to share our vision with the judges. Thank) Tj T* (you for considering our application and we look forward to the opportunity to grow with your) Tj T* (support.) Tj ET
